_2710374385793731_4335129908217143921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x4iZpCQLAWcQ7kNvwEhe7q6&_nc_oc=AdqKc6z2gIyTH0O-giD5TE-n7mI4zmRClQYe2Gx2CKocYW1acnjTMct9thlzfGDBeyM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBiz1lOtqDN8d4uDQBzFVzlb5-b5ojTIO6VQ_bPfRiDFA&oe=6A5A33DE"}, {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "1819549741885168", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984474_1819549745218501_878499352484891744_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wqb3XOEaJQUQ7kNvwHiSyzy&_nc_oc=AdpQ6pgalJ-pChpAynv3QYHj67qxPjxSQM2brUmBd-SFOvWXVwYvFN1qU7py1pgOwgw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBL22NxVfqT7hgnuF3Fqex-alyNeOo2xMYVhIXp-VdIfw&oe=6A5A41ED"}, {"file_name": "002.png", "id": "790364216531353", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974483_790364219864686_8155488325575676486_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eitFdTcCN9UQ7kNvwG2cW8F&_nc_oc=Adpn3a7X1yBho1oVAN2-SZW47xYUvXxIopNwk6HJeB6q2fRowYVGDLrCtpzsIYhtmJU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCcDTo5B8F7Fo2bDroFOZo_9hVHMYVzl1BckhITlvmZtg&oe=6A5A21EC"}, {"file_name": "001.png", "id": "1205543714149528", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75269591_1205543717482861_1636873667456873713_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sRftv6sInIMQ7kNvwGXzYGZ&_nc_oc=AdrwssFWfhiDlu7sL_Uo4cIdDMfXcmrW0llI6bm241pXkowkkSE7tRdnC_ybAx3WnmI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCo73hNDMywphVkcIieaCcW8KSQY8fR2pWdO7HguK4vZQ&oe=6A5A29B4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "476707408073775", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75294244_476707411407108_5418331704720470775_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KhcdA_aAZRkQ7kNvwHGNK8c&_nc_oc=AdoVEvP3QS7eKhufB8Al_PG7kUDsgWuetzVQesmYYmW4UcJgaQL4nxH2dVNM-G0qX9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDX4BBq43Jm42204CPY1iZAIFani5n2aAnL9xsJb0cOiQ&oe=6A5A19B8"}, "display_name": "Virnect View", "keywords": ["virnect", "view", "ar", "industry", "virnectview"], "long_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency with VIRNECT View.\n\nEasily augment manuals on actual equipment to confirm equipment usage.\n\nCheck real-time field data and operate processes efficiently.\n\nShorten training time for new employees by utilizing realistic educational content.\n\n[Main Features]\n\nSpatial-based AR Content Visualization\nAllows for more accurate problem confirmation than paper manuals\n\nOffline Environment Support\nDownload AR content to your device for easy access even in offline environments.\n\nReal-time Data Monitoring\nConnects data information to content for direct on-site viewing.\n\nWork Result Report Writing\nCreate reports while viewing AR content.\n(Supports text input, photo capture, and checklist-style work reporting)\n\nImmersive Content\nProvides a more immersive content experience through various animations and interaction functions.\n\n[Access Permission Guide]\n\nIf necessary access is not allowed, there may be restrictions on service usage.\n\n[Open Source License Guide]\n\nIn-App Information Notification\n\n[Customer Support Center]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/support/inquiry\n\n[Website]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/\n\nThis is an enterprise app. Please purchase licenses from the payment center (web) to use.", "short_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency by using VIRNECT View.\n\nYou can easily check how to use the equipment by augmenting the manual on the actual equipment.\n\nSee real-time field data and operate the process efficiently.\n\nTraining time for new employees can be shortened by using realistic educational content."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://console.virnect.com/legal?type=policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://console.virnect.com/l